    {
      "id": "ac9077ef-bb7e-43b2-ae5b-1bd590866862",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe que a frase explica por que a mudança passou a fazer sentido.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ed520d8e-0c9d-4ace-bd1f-3019a711392f",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>darse cuenta de que...</strong> introduz a percepção que mudou tudo.</p><p>Em <strong>Me di cuenta de que quería un cambio.</strong>, a frase explica por que a decisão foi decisiva.</p><p>Ela funciona bem quando você quer contar a razão profunda de uma mudança de rumo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "78a7a639-de3f-473c-acd6-0a847ceac5ae",
      "title": "Uma virada em poucas falas",
      "description": "<p>Escute como uma pessoa resume o momento que mudou sua trajetória.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Cuál fue el momento clave?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Qual foi o momento-chave?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2201a6b3f04942a1a6df89501b22ad63_b07-dialogo-linea-01.mp3?Expires=1794099677&Signature=cm-IS-KFll5VXzucG1vCx4WV7v5nch5bydunNnIXo46jJ8045DZ0nJIn-5YdJjPFtVmc4WbVBX18aUvvBp1P~q4hbKv1TI4eTIp-IBQ~2W1j3cRRyjAnh2it~FsM-4pKbDHwX1tgeZf~eLYmLTotdjgwCR98y7i-ejGBZf1oEAutc1juVpKXFada~rALKbAJcIWTV-yn1TO8vT65v6etCGpaocONmx9CSLnknovBwYHmdShVg~6eCoRfTHPECcSXPEJxuOe6W5JaUY1EeftLfXc7WzLwg0~grE25tsgYmqsHLx5aKuk0hxhHyXWxyECUnyrYMwFHSeSgz5hpJegj0A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Dejé de trabajar por la noche.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Parei de trabalhar à noite.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b7a1c664ead848a6840dad550f253bd8_b07-dialogo-linea-02.mp3?Expires=1794099677&Signature=ea2gImNv8VGGjNKfvqc-N0JIOMQuIXFDvIg94aLHjyNKAc5S~GGA-RQQ0MIpTiHm6-O00Anc6aHvUyBVj1SQV6l85FAQC7sIXwrIHnEPN~JzS1HLtNy~mJARwXzvRIZGyNlk3CJsHDDXRSszOWuOuyZCngU28vufCY0cX6Ya1k6A8cZJPVcy4UcLpS4rU3ig8jqCg0CgFYdYjUzH2EKBo8ecH9W9T0-L0W7eYmKSob5eICjIifWYSUSIexhY1NYjo-FUstyGsRDeg~uS~k368r7B4E98lNL8~oT3P-bVJzyHq7r99k1z4PVfdUg727HrBiZXZqHsVFALpzCeIsgjPA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Después volví a estudiar y me di cuenta de que quería un cambio.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Depois voltei a estudar e percebi que queria uma mudança.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0b6481c6b1c7480ea831ebc4d8b1f0b5_b07-dialogo-linea-03.mp3?Expires=1794099677&Signature=kPWLY~qj~fjhoq-MwXIcAUHCrqWZj6~ZQ8oxhzK19k3J9M083npyWN8p32t-XM2gTxbmSu0CGX6xtpVlMZ63BfmkpOtOLvFgny9GycBdIjw2ZJDGJm9uoGYWCpLjO5V6p7pQLa6LizUiNT8oCyFmM6JMbq0cnCRDcX5jQw8D-N~ynNUWyF~OnE4-Tsexq5m6OdHOz9~lQAqEsQJnhu1LPmpjcodAz4HozwFyMdeI4riOhulN6LLJnTFqH9zokZHFB1YGvpkhGz0cfVfwF7kS6iNqFbOqroNqNUtqntls1SJiFb7rsEtTZ5jGd6qDHSkE7X8Upqpgifz1sPKqhnuNfw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Entonces esa decisión abrió otra etapa.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Então essa decisão abriu outra etapa.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1db040bade0549a4881495928dec89e6_b07-dialogo-linea-04.mp3?Expires=1794099677&Signature=2SAxTiV6dLciJlSZwcJgz0XSMBcajo3jBMaCujL7SRgrhX-95scX5ofpCtqi-VorXgBv9OCk7jtP5nSIYl71BLnN-zxXxSco-~nwjtgidJJ~KWnqdLFMZEl0JCHp9vfMs5mRMUstCs0pna65EnndrYRFtLlCr8HxTnxIiSrzWyUuZjRn4aCoX6bLo~MAzhAyiG-aSfb8IwlNx4mgNjWf9F1W1svPFLoHNXjuB~ligeX-EF~mUvfph2c-Z-u3iH6XKrOV1ugnhMM8wC8~rZTD6gYN7pc3c0X0K~TyqP8txInrTDInQYJgfvhWWayfE4Obfjrb09v7y01sRLZ~nX9J6g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        }
      ],
